# 🇨🇦 Newfoundland and Labrador — The Ultimate Travel Guide

## Welcome to Newfoundland and Labrador

Newfoundland and Labrador is Canada's easternmost province and one of the most unique destinations in the world.

A place where dramatic coastlines meet the Atlantic Ocean, ancient mountains rise from the sea, colourful fishing villages sit beside rugged cliffs, and wildlife thrives in some of Canada's most untouched landscapes.

Known for its friendly people, rich maritime culture, incredible scenery, and powerful connection to the ocean, Newfoundland and Labrador offers travelers an experience unlike anywhere else in Canada.

This is a destination for explorers, photographers, nature lovers, and anyone looking for a place that still feels wild.

