# The Spirit of Newfoundland and Labrador

Newfoundland and Labrador is a place where the ocean shapes everything.

It is the sound of waves against ancient cliffs, the glow of a lighthouse at sunset, the sight of whales beneath a vast sky, the warmth of a small fishing village, and the feeling of standing at the edge of the Atlantic.

This province does not simply welcome visitors.

It invites them to become part of its story.
